    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "The dataset consists of the raw signal return from the AAD POLAR (Polarisation) lidar for both the co-polarisation and cross-polarisation channels.\n\nThe AAD POLAR lidar was housed in the CPC building at Davis Station\n\nResolution: 30m vertically x 10 seconds\n\nTime period: November 2018 - November 2019.\n\nNote that the data have not been range-corrected, overlap-corrected, calibrated nor background-corrected. These post-processing need doing prior to using these data for further analyses.",
